{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of <strong>BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the full release, please add it to your wishlist and await further updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Experience the EVOBATTLE!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039440/extras/00afb0cc4150b79d164fffb78e120100.poster.avif?t=1760359172\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039440/extras/00afb0cc4150b79d164fffb78e120100.webm?t=1760359172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039440/extras/00afb0cc4150b79d164fffb78e120100.mp4?t=1760359172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE</i> is  the &quot;<strong>BEYBLADE ACTION</strong>&quot; game where you take control of your customized Beys and battle powerful opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four Beys Type to master: <strong>Attack Type, Stamina Type, Defense Type, and Balance Type</strong>. Each Type comes with its own strengths, weaknesses, and unique characteristics in both offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match requires strategy and precise control to outplay your opponent in high-speed Battle. Get ready for edge-of-your-seat action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can experience Battle using\u00a0<strong>Attack Type Beys</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio: Japanese. All text, including story, available in English.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039440?t=1760359172","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4